  "solution": "We substitute the options in the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nGiven: 12 × 7 ÷ 4 + 12 – 20 = 5\n\nOption 1) 5 and 7\n\n12 × __**5 ÷ 4**__ + 12 – 20 = 7\n\n__**12 × 1.25**__ + 12 – 20 = 7\n\n__**15 + 12**__ – 20 = 7\n\n__**27 - 20**__ = 7\n\n7 = 7\n\nOption 2) 4 and 5\n12 × __**7 ÷ 5**__ + 12 – 20 = 4\n\n__**12 × **____1.4__** + 12 – 20 = 4**\n__**16.8 **____**+ 12**__ – 20 = 4\n\n__**28.8 - 20**__ = 4\n\n8.8 ≠ 4\n\nOption 3) 7 and 20\n12 × __**20 ÷ 4**__ + 12 – 7 = 5\n\n__**12 × **____5__** + 12 – 7 = 5**\n__**60 **____**+ 12**__ – 7 = 5\n\n__**72 - 7**__ = 5\n\n65 ≠ 5\n\nOption 4) 4 and 12\n12 × __**7 ÷ 12**__ + 4 – 20 = 5\n\n__**12 × **____0.5__** + 4 – 20 = 5\n\n__**6 + 4**__ – 20 = 5\n\n10 - 20 = 5 \n\n-10 ≠ 5\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**option (1)\".**",
